spec_io.py	Read .spec files, locate header files, parse header metadata, basic file loading.
metadata.py	Metadata normalization and conversion helpers such as parsefrequencyghz, parsetemperaturevalue, extracthotcoldkelvin, getheadervalue.
analysis.py	Pure numerical routines like despike1d, despike1dinwindow, frequencyoffsettobinindex, computebinwindowfromcenterfreq, spectroscopyconvert, computecoldminushot, computemedianhotcolddistance.
calibration.py	Calibration-specific math such as computenoisetemperature..., calibratespectrumtotemperature, hot/cold averaging, file mean spectrum.
plotting.py	Non-interactive plotting only: plotspectrum, hot/cold average plots, noise temperature plots, top-axis helpers, axis formatting.
browser.py	Interactive Matplotlib browser code with buttons/sliders like launchinteractivenoisetemperaturebrowser.
dialogs.py	Tkinter directory/file chooser helpers such as choosedirectory. 

modules should only answer one question.